OL,3,GNEWSAWhen and how parking charges will
OL,4,Achange in Wiltshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of parking in Wiltshire is set
OL,7,Fto rise for the first time in four
OL,8,Fyears in a bid to reflect "increasing
OL,9,Fcosts".
OL,11,FWiltshire Council said changes - such
OL,12,Fas a 20% increase in pay and display
OL,13,Fparking - will come into force on 1
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FParking charges have not risen in
OL,17,FWiltshire since 2022 and the council
OL,18,Fsaid the changes follow a public
OL,19,Fconsultation which received 1,762
OL,20,Fresponses.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
