OL,3,GNEWSAWhen and how parking charges will
OL,4,Achange in Wiltshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Smith, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for highways, said: "Given
OL,8,Fsignificant inflation during that time,
OL,9,Fwe had to raise them now to help pay
OL,10,Ffor the increasing costs in providing
OL,11,Fthe service and to reinvest in our
OL,12,Fwider transport infrastructure,
OL,13,Fincluding our rural bus network."
